\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Device and materials context from the TMAT study. (a), (b) The two capacitor stacks differ in interface design, with Stack~B including a deliberate WO$_x$ layer. (c) GIXRD confirms ferroelectric-phase formation in the Hf$_{0.5}$Zr$_{0.5}$O$_2${} films. (d) Polarization and interfacial-chemistry context motivate the interface-focused interpretation used in the reduced manuscript.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
